      "mechanism_critical_numbers_preserved": false,
      "name_en": "Prowling Projectile",
      "name_zh": "摸鱼飞弹",
      "slot": "q",
      "source_ref_ids": [
        "source:ddragon:16.16.1:zh_CN:Yuumi",
        "source:ddragon:16.16.1:en_US:Yuumi",
        "source:communitydragon:16.16:zh_cn:Yuumi",
        "source:wiki:1393010:4008652"
      ],
      "status_terms_zh": [
        "减速"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Yuumi fires a missile, dealing damage and slowing first target hit. It deals bonus damage and an enchanced slow if it takes at least 1.35 seconds to get to its target. While on her Best Friend, the slow is always enhanced and grants bonus On-Hit damage to her ally. While Attached, the missile can be controlled with your cursor for a brief period.",
      "summary_zh": "悠米发射一道飞弹，对命中的首个单位造成伤害和减速效果。如果它在到达目标之前至少飞行了1.35秒，那么还会造成额外伤害和强化减速效果。在附身于她的挚友身上时，将总造成强化减速效果并且为她的挚友提供额外附加伤害。 在附身状态时，飞弹可以通过你的指针来控制。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1393010:4008652"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ability_id": "ability:Yuumi:w:ddragon-16.16.1",
      "damage_types": [
        "none"
      ],
      "detailed_description_zh": "被动：在附身于她的挚友身上时，悠米获得额外的【数值】%治疗与护盾强度并且她的这名友军也会获得附加%i:OnHit%【数值】治疗效果。 主动：悠米突进到一名目标友方英雄处，并附身到该友军身上。当悠米处于附身状态时，她会跟随她搭档的移动并且不可被选取（防御塔除外）。 对悠米施加定身效果会使这个技能进入为期【数值】秒的冷却时间。",
      "extraction": {
        "method": "deterministic_client_markup_v1",
