      "summary_en": "Yuumi channels five waves that damage enemies and heal allies. Yuumi can move, attach, and cast Zoomies! while channeling. While on her Best Friend, this spell also follows her mouse.",
      "summary_zh": "悠米引导5道波纹来伤害敌人并治疗友军。在引导时，悠米可以移动、附身并施放【旺盛精力】。在附身于她的挚友身上时，这个技能还会跟随她的鼠标。",
